        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "He! Tingkau thanmei ninge",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! Tingkau thanmei ninge sam kei o,",
            "Alung jingmei guai hei timan lou o;",
            "Rianra jingmei rui ata duam liam the,",
            "Tingsang gaimei Eden than gaimei 8#@.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He! Poubaumei kata karana khang,",
            "Ringmei dui khun ne poubaumei nang;",
            "Katik-kagun daimei tingkau ram gai,",
            "Nang dinge aniu ta gumliam lou o.",
            "",
            "2. Reikhou Eden pilung khou bam pui tang,",
            "Kandih pap sipui bam khou bam lana;",
            "Kalvari ching gaimei pan khou ruina,",
            "Tingsang salem than gaimei 8#@ lani.",
            "",
            "3. Nangjan 8#@ huai pukhou jingmei man e,",
            "Bumang thanmei kandih thuan ku puni;",
            "Aram neila airui sa thai makge,",
            "Hei 8#@ ninga akhang tinggan pat the.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih mun gaimei guaini puang tuai the,",
            "Neila pui tuang guaini man puni the;",
            "He! Poubaumei lunmu tuai dat lak khe,",
            "Hei 8#@ akhang tingsanga puang puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
